OL,3,GNEWSA'Maybe it was my fate to walk in
OL,4,Awith no legs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Nott has never let anything
OL,7,Fhold her back.
OL,9,FThe student, from Oxford, is a
OL,10,Fquadruple amputee, having lost the
OL,11,Flower parts of her arms and legs to
OL,12,Fmeningitis when she was just two years
OL,13,Fold.
OL,15,FNow 18, Charlotte is a contestant in
OL,16,Fthe latest series of Big Brother,
OL,17,Fsomething she has dreamed about for
OL,18,Fmost of her life.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
