OL,3,GNEWSA'Maybe it was my fate to walk in
OL,4,Awith no legs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer dad, Alex, told BBC Radio Oxford he
OL,7,Fwas anxious about her appearance on the
OL,8,Fshow, but said there had never been
OL,9,Fmuch point telling his daughter not to
OL,10,Fdo something she had her sights on.
